WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.090
SHINING SOUL

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:06.530
I'm sure that what we saw wasn't even the full extent of their power.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.700
The Chinese team is strong.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:15.070
To defeat them, our BBA team will need a serious power up.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.660
I need to complete my research, and fast.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:24.450
I have to work hard as a member of the BBA team.

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:36.420
Rei Loses Byakko!

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.460
Looks like it's going to rain tonight.

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:51.810
This is good.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.150
What are doing, Kiki?

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:57.280
Oh, it's just you, Mao...
Don't scare me like that.

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:00.970
Why are you up in the middle of the night?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.030
What about you? Why are <i>you</i> awake?

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:04.880
Bathroom.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.090
I see.

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.540
I'm going out for a bit. Don't tell the others.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.060
Where are you going..?

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:17.540
I'm going to sneak into the BBA team's base and get some info on them.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:21.060
I might even manage to steal Byakko's Bit back.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.050
Don't do it. Attacking while they're asleep is a cowardly move.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.730
I hate cowards!

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.440
You're only saying that because Rei's your opponent.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.030
I know how you feel about him.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.720
What are you saying..?!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:38.340
Rei-nii-- I mean Rei, he's just a traitor.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:41.140
I want to crush him with my own hands!

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.850
I want to win against the BBA team.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.700
I will never forget that humiliation.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.900
I want to defeat them, I don't care how!

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:56.550
And then...

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:57.330
Mao.

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:01.680
I'm sorry but I'm going to beat Rei myself.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.280
If I do that, Rai will finally recognize me as a full fledged clan member.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:09.270
You should just forget about Rei.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:16.700
Kiki!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.210
Rei-nii...

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:32.980
To achieve a power up, I need to strengthen this part a bit.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.460
Oh, and also...

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.320
The wind..?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.600
I got inside so easily... They're completely defenseless.

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.580
BBA team, you're too lax!

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:20.850
Okay, Okay, I get it... I'll train, Grandpa...

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.620
Come on, let me go already...

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:53.620
Rei..!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:59.580
Attacking while they're asleep is a cowardly move. I hate cowards!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.090
I am not...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:04.290
I am not a coward.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.700
So I won't attack you while you're asleep.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:12.830
I will defeat you and take the Sacred Beast Byakko's Bit back with me...

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.280
but only while you're awake.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.410
I'm not going to steal Byakko, but I'm not leaving empty handed.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.130
A research lab, maybe?

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:45.010
Now I know what I need to do! I'll have some tea then go back to work.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.070
T-This..!

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.560
This is incredible! He's gathered all this data by himself?

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.690
This could be really useful to the Chinese team.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.560
I'll be taking this data.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.620
Come on! Hurry up and finish copying!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:49.250
Who's there?

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:55.610
You're Kiki from the Chinese team!

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.130
Stop!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.640
Give back the data you stole!

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:24.450
With this data, we'll be able to find out the BBA team's weak points.

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:26.750
Who's there?!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:37.950
Rei?!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:39.270
Kiki...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.350
Wait!

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.070
Rei! He's stolen my data!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.090
I know.

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:56.100
I'll go call Takao and the others.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.550
Give back the Professor's research data.

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:03.100
If you do that, I can pretend I didn't see you.

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.100
Pretend you didn't see me? Don't make me laugh!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:10.310
If you want the data back, you'll have to take them from me by force!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:15.560
Those are the results of the research the Professor has been conducting for a long time now.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:20.580
I'm sure even you understand
just how important they are to him.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:24.850
Do you think it's right for you to get them so easily?

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:27.920
Shut up.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.830
It doesn't have to be like this.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.000
Kiki...

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.520
Shut up! Shut up, shut up!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:43.010
You <i>always</i> do this! You're looking down on me!

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.260
I used to respect you.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:52.540
You, who at a young age were already accepted by Byakko's Bit and recognized as a member of the clan...

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:53.530
Kiki...

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.960
When I found out that the guy Mao was in love with was you...

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:03.040
Sure I was frustrated, but if it was you I could accept it. I would have been fine with that.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.940
And yet... And yet, you..!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:11.300
As if abandoning our clan wasn't enough, you even came back as our enemy!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.300
You don't understand, Kiki.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.770
What is there to understand?!

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:20.480
I never meant to abandon or betray the clan.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.720
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.950
Do you think I will trust the words of a traitor?!

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:33.610
If you want to stop me, if you want me to give the data back... Fight me!

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:34.850
Kiki...

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.130
Takao, it's terrible! Please wake up!

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.700
What's going on..?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.130
I can't eat anymore...

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.940
This is no time to be sleep talking!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.340
Rei... Rei is..!

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:59.430
Rei..? What happened to Rei?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:02.410
<i>What..?</i> What's going on, Professor?

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.590
No time to explain! It's terrible!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:05.940
Kiki and Rei are..!

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:09.150
Just hurry and get up, guys!

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:11.520
Kiki, put that down.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.650
Rei, fight me.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.260
I will defeat you.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.930
So you're not going to listen?

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.380
Fair enough, I <i>will</i> fight you.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:25.650
But if I win, you will give back the disc.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:30.400
Very well, I will give it back.
But will it be that easy for you?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.020
Here I go!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.520
Three, Two, One!

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.650
Go... Shoot!

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:17.180
Kiki, you can't win against me!

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.170
Don't underestimate my Garman.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.180
Did you see that?!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.200
It seems you have gotten a bit stronger.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:34.210
Don't think I'm the same as before!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.400
But still... It's still not enough!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:41.860
What?!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.790
Don't think you've won yet, Rei.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.670
It's the Sacred Beast!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:18.720
Don't think you can beat me just by using your Sacred Beast, Kiki.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.940
Can you hear Driger's warcry?

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.680
Byakko!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:47.160
Rei...

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:51.390
You're really set on taking me down, aren't you?

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:57.570
Of course. Since you appeared before me as an enemy, I <i>will</i> defeat you!

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.100
Enemy..? You call me an enemy?!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.740
I never hold back while fighting. This is the end!

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:10.980
We were comrades... And now you're seriously coming at me to defeat me?!

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:16.800
Can you really step on your comrades and think nothing of it?! Tell me, Rei!

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:18.780
I-I am...

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:23.780
I am...

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:28.750
What's wrong, Driger?

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:38.930
You're soft, Rei. Too soft! Did you lose your fighting spirit when you left the Byakko clan?

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.560
What's wrong? Why aren't you attacking..?

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.720
Byakko! What's happening?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:02.680
Byakko!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.360
Rei-nii...

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:34.850
I'm sure you know it too. The legend says that Byakko will not stay by the side of those who don't fight with all they've got.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.570
Byakko abandoned you!

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:41.220
I-Impossible! That' can't be!

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.090
I <i>was</i> fighting with all I had..!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.890
Did you really abandon me, Byakko..?

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:54.580
Now that Byakko left you, you can't call yourself part of the Byakko clan anymore.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:56.620
Rei,

00:15:56.620 --> 00:16:01.600
by not fighting with everything you have, you betrayed Byakko.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:07.120
Now that you don't have Byakko by your side, your Driger is not a threat anymore!

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:09.990
I never betrayed the clan!

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:12.850
And I would never ever betray Byakko!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.050
This fight is my win!

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:20.870
Go! Drunk Monkey Attack!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:28.870
Who's getting in the way of our duel?!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:33.370
You see, I can't just stand there while my friends are in trouble.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:34.770
Friends..?

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:41.100
You're calling Rei your friend?
He could betray you some day!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.100
What a foolish bunch.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:46.610
Rei is not the kind of man who would betray us!

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:54.450
Keep believing that. You'll find out for yourself just how painful it is to be betrayed.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:57.490
Byakko...

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:01.000
Are you saying I didn't fight with all I had?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.520
Is this why you decided to abandon me..?

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.000
Give them back! Give back the data!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.230
If you do, we can all forget about what happened.

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:15.520
Very well. But if you want them back...

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.210
I knew it.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:23.430
I will be your opponent.

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:25.530
Let's fight!

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:30.680
Go, Garman!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.260
What's wrong? Is this the best your Dragoon can do?

00:17:54.260 --> 00:18:02.610
Kiki, a friend is someone who stays by your side and believes in you no matter what happens to you.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:08.050
You didn't believe Rei's words, and that means you were never a real friend!

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:13.860
I believe in Rei. He's my friend! And I won't forgive whoever hurts my friends!

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.610
Go, Dragoon!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.050
It's the end for you!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.210
What?!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.690
So, can we have our data back now?

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.690
Ah! He's getting away!

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.080
Come back, Kiki!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:03.210
Stop.

00:19:06.430 --> 00:19:08.260
Come on, Kiki. A deal's a deal.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.670
Or are you the kind of coward who goes back on his word?

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:15.710
I am not a coward.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:23.090
Don't put me together with Rei!

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:27.600
Rei, now that Byakko has left you, you're no threat to us.

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.850
Remember this!

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:50.610
I would have been so easy to take down that guy, and yet you let him get away...

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.190
And you call yourself a Beyblader?

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:59.830
It's because you fight half-heartedly that Byakko abandoned you.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:04.710
Byakko is power incarnated. If you fight, do it with everything you've got.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:07.740
If you don't, you'll be a hindrance.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:12.390
I... I thought I was fighting wholeheartedly...

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.910
You thought, huh...

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:25.860
If that's how it is, you're even more of a hindrance.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.190
Mao...

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.910
What happened, Rei?

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.570
Rei-nii is crying...

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:06.210
Don't cry. You mustn't cry, Rei-nii!

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:08.900
You mustn't cry!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:01.860
According to my analysis, Rei was pretty shaken by what happened.

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.430
In fact he disappeared from the BBA team, only leaving behind a letter.

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:10.410
The one who got in touch with Rei was Mao!

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.470
Could Rei end up as a member of the Chinese team?!

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:17.650
Next time: Farewell, BBA Team.

00:23:17.650 --> 00:23:21.680
Rei, can you really throw away your feelings like that?

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:23.910
<i>Come back!</i>
